Shaders compiled ahead beyond vertex programs: PrecompileShader queues any shader (its source, entry point and
profile) on the precompile threads, the renderer queues its own at startup (the depth copy, the blit, the clear, the
point sprites) and an extension can queue its passes' (Context::Pass: the entry with ps_5_0, and vs). A level's first
frame, which made them on the spot, no longer stalls on them.

